Viscous is a spirit-scaling brawler whose entire kit is built around goo — puddles of it, cubes of it, and a giant ball of it. His four abilities give him wave-clear, a unique protect/disable button, long-range disruption, and a high-impact engage ultimate.

<deadlockabilityindex />

== The kit ==
Click any ability above for its full stats and upgrade tiers.

* '''[[Splatter]]''' — thrown goo that damages and leaves slowing puddles.
* '''[[The Cube]]''' — encases a target in restorative goo, protecting and healing them while they can't act.
* '''[[Puddle Punch]]''' — a long-range fist that punches and slows everyone in an area.
* '''[[Goo Ball]]''' (ultimate) — morph into a rolling ball that stuns and shrugs off damage.

